# 🔒 Security Policy

Security is one of the highest priorities at Codexeron.

## Reporting Security Issues

If you discover a vulnerability:

- Do not publish it publicly.
- Contact us privately.
- Include detailed reproduction steps.

## Responsible Disclosure

Please allow us time to investigate and resolve the issue before public disclosure.

## Website

https://www.codexeron.com

Thank you for helping keep Codexeron secure.
